<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>ABLE System Architecture v7.0</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

:root {
    --space-dark: #05070f;
    --panel-surface: #0a0f1b;
    --border-matrix: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    --input-bg: #03050a;

    --matrix-green: #10b981;
    --quantum-cyan: #06b6d4;
    --alert-amber: #f59e0b;
    --critical-red: #ef4444;

    --text-high: #f8fafc;
    --text-low: #64748b;

    --font-ui: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
}

* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    background-color: var(--space-dark);
    color: var(--text-high);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 1.5rem;
}

.app-shell {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
}

/* =========================================================
   HEADER
========================================================= */

.workspace-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-matrix);
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
}

.brand-block {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
}

.matrix-node {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background-color: var(--matrix-green);
    border-radius: 2px;
}

.brand-block h2 {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}

.text-gradient {
    background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        var(--matrix-green),
        var(--quantum-cyan)
    );

    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
}

.system-status {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-low);
}

/* =========================================================
   MAIN GRID
========================================================= */

.dashboard-grid-matrix {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
}

.span-4-cols {
    grid-column: span 4;
}

/* =========================================================
   CARDS
========================================================= */

.panel-card {
    background-color: var(--panel-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-matrix);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    position: relative;
}

.status-optimal {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--matrix-green);
}

.status-warning {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--alert-amber);
}

.status-critical {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--critical-red);
}

.panel-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
}

.plane-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-low);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
}

.zone-flag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.05rem 0.3rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
}

.zone-flag.optimal {
    background: rgba(16,185,129,0.1);
    color: var(--matrix-green);
}

.zone-flag.warning {
    background: rgba(245,158,11,0.1);
    color: var(--alert-amber);
}

.zone-flag.critical {
    background: rgba(239,68,68,0.1);
    color: var(--critical-red);
}

.panel-title {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-low);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
}

.panel-data {
    margin: 0.2rem 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.15rem;
}

.big-num {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
}

.data-unit {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-low);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
}

.threshold-tracker {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--text-low);
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    padding-top: 0.4rem;
    border-top: 1px dotted var(--border-matrix);
}

/* =========================================================
   EDUCATIONAL MICRO-PANELS
========================================================= */

.learning-question {
    color: var(--text-high);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
}

.learning-answer {
    color: var(--text-low);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
}

.learning-answer strong {
    color: var(--text-high);
}

.metric-example {
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.025);
    color: var(--quantum-cyan);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.63rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
}

/* =========================================================
   PLAYBOOK
========================================================= */

.edu-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-matrix);
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
}

.edu-column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
}

.edu-column h4 {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: var(--text-high);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
}

.edu-column p {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-low);
    line-height: 1.4;
}

.edu-accent-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--quantum-cyan);
    background: rgba(6,182,212,0.05);
    padding: 0.2rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
}

.card-block-title {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
}

.card-block-sub {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-low);
    line-height: 1.45;
}

/* =========================================================
   FORM
========================================================= */

.form-row-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 0.5rem;
    width: 100%;
}

.input-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
}

.input-wrapper label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-low);
}

.matrix-input,
.matrix-select {
    background-color: var(--input-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-matrix);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-high);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    outline: none;
}

.matrix-input:focus,
.matrix-select:focus {
    border-color: var(--quantum-cyan);
}

.btn-submit {
    background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        var(--matrix-green),
        var(--quantum-cyan)
    );

    color: var(--space-dark);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    align-self: flex-end;
}

/* =========================================================
   TABLE
========================================================= */

.matrix-table-container {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: var(--input-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-matrix);
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow-x: auto;
}

.matrix-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
}

.matrix-table th {
    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.01);
    padding: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-low);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-matrix);
}

.matrix-table td {
    padding: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-matrix);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
}

.matrix-table tbody tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
}

/* =========================================================
   ANALYSIS
========================================================= */

.analysis-footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
}

.analysis-block {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01);
    border: 1px dashed var(--border-matrix);
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
}

.analysis-block h5 {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-high);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
}

.analysis-block p {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-low);
    line-height: 1.4;
}

/* =========================================================
   TECHNICAL MATRIX
========================================================= */

.deep-technical-matrix {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-matrix);
    padding-top: 1rem;
}

.audit-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding-right: 1rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border-matrix);
}

.audit-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-low);
}

.audit-item strong {
    color: var(--text-high);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    min-width: 45px;
}

.remediation-flow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
}

.remediation-step {
    background: #070d18;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.08);
}

.remediation-step h6 {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--alert-amber);
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
}

.remediation-step p {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-low);
}

/* =========================================================
   CALCULATIONS
========================================================= */

.calc-matrix-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
}

.calc-sheet {
    background: #03060c;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-matrix);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.75rem;
}

.calc-sheet h4 {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--quantum-cyan);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--border-matrix);
    padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
}

.calc-sheet p {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-low);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
}

.math-image-box {
    background: #060912;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
}

.math-svg {
    max-height: 38px;
    width: auto;
    fill: #f8fafc;
}

.formula-box {
    width: 100%;
    background: #060912;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    color: var(--quantum-cyan);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    white-space: normal;
    word-break: break-word;
}

.audit-check-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
}

.check-node {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-matrix);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.4rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--text-low);
}

.check-node strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-high);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.1rem;
}

/* =========================================================
   RESPONSIVE
========================================================= */

@media (max-width: 1100px) {

    .dashboard-grid-matrix,
    .edu-grid,
    .analysis-footer-grid,
    .calc-matrix-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .deep-technical-matrix {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .audit-list {
        border-right: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-matrix);
        padding-bottom: 1rem;
        padding-right: 0;
    }

    .span-4-cols {
        grid-column: span 2;
    }

    .form-row-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {

    body {
        padding: 0.75rem;
    }

    .workspace-header {
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .system-status {
        font-size: 0.6rem;
        text-align: right;
    }

    .dashboard-grid-matrix,
    .edu-grid,
    .analysis-footer-grid,
    .calc-matrix-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .span-4-cols {
        grid-column: span 1;
    }

    .form-row-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .audit-check-row {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="app-shell">

<header class="workspace-header">

<div class="brand-block">

<div class="matrix-node"></div>

<h2>
ABLE <span class="text-gradient">CONSOLE</span>
</h2>

</div>

<div class="system-status">
SYS_ACTIVE // LEARNING_CORE_LOADED
</div>

</header>


<div class="dashboard-grid-matrix">


<!-- =====================================================
     ATTENTION
====================================================== -->

<div class="panel-card status-optimal">

<div>

<div class="panel-header">

<span class="plane-tag">[A] FIELD</span>

<span class="zone-flag optimal">
CORE
</span>

</div>

<h2 class="panel-title">
Attention Field
</h2>

<div class="panel-data">

<span
class="big-num"
style="color:var(--matrix-green);">
84.2
</span>

<span class="data-unit">
example score
</span>

</div>

<p class="learning-question">
<strong>What is this?</strong>
</p>

<p class="learning-answer">
Attention is the ability to keep mental resources directed toward a chosen task while resisting competing inputs.
</p>

<div class="metric-example">
Example: 84.2 = strong focus period, not a medical measurement.
</div>

</div>

<div class="threshold-tracker">
LEARN: Focus ≠ time spent // Focus = useful attention retained
</div>

</div>


<!-- =====================================================
     BEHAVIOR
====================================================== -->

<div class="panel-card status-warning">

<div>

<div class="panel-header">

<span class="plane-tag">[B] LOOP</span>

<span class="zone-flag warning">
WATCH
</span>

</div>

<h2 class="panel-title">
Behavioral Flow
</h2>

<div class="panel-data">

<span
class="big-num"
style="color:var(--alert-amber);">
10.1
</span>

<span class="data-unit">
example yield
</span>

</div>

<p class="learning-question">
<strong>What is this?</strong>
</p>

<p class="learning-answer">
Behavioral flow measures the gap between what you intend to do and what you repeatedly execute.
</p>

<div class="metric-example">
Planned 10 actions → completed 7 → execution rate = 70%
</div>

</div>

<div class="threshold-tracker">
LEARN: Repeated behavior creates systems, not isolated intentions
</div>

</div>


<!-- =====================================================
     LEVERAGE
====================================================== -->

<div class="panel-card status-critical">

<div>

<div class="panel-header">

<span class="plane-tag">[L] FULCRUM</span>

<span class="zone-flag critical">
REVIEW
</span>

</div>

<h2 class="panel-title">
Leverage Factor
</h2>

<div class="panel-data">

<span
class="big-num"
style="color:var(--critical-red);">
1.85
</span>

<span class="data-unit">
example x
</span>

</div>

<p class="learning-question">
<strong>What is this?</strong>
</p>

<p class="learning-answer">
Leverage asks how much meaningful output an activity produces relative to the time, energy, or resources required.
</p>

<div class="metric-example">
Impact 9 ÷ Effort 3 = 3.0x leverage
</div>

</div>

<div class="threshold-tracker">
LEARN: More activity does not automatically mean more progress
</div>

</div>


<!-- =====================================================
     ENVIRONMENT
====================================================== -->

<div class="panel-card status-optimal">

<div>

<div class="panel-header">

<span class="plane-tag">[E] STRUCT</span>

<span class="zone-flag optimal">
CORE
</span>

</div>

<h2 class="panel-title">
Choice Architecture
</h2>

<div class="panel-data">

<span
class="big-num"
style="color:var(--matrix-green);">
91.3
</span>

<span class="data-unit">
example %
</span>

</div>

<p class="learning-question">
<strong>What is this?</strong>
</p>

<p class="learning-answer">
Choice architecture is the design of your surroundings that makes some actions easier, harder, more visible, or more automatic.
</p>

<div class="metric-example">
5 useful defaults × 20% = 100% environment score
</div>

</div>

<div class="threshold-tracker">
LEARN: Change the environment before blaming motivation
</div>

</div>


<!-- =====================================================
     EDUCATIONAL PLAYBOOK
====================================================== -->

<div
class="panel-card span-4-cols"
style="
background-color:#0d1527;
border-color:rgba(6,182,212,0.15);
">

<div>

<h3
class="card-block-title"
style="color:var(--quantum-cyan);">
ABLE Engineering Playbook
</h3>

<p
class="card-block-sub"
style="color:#94a3b8;">
The four dimensions work together. The purpose is not to create impressive-looking numbers. The purpose is to understand why performance succeeds, degrades, and recovers.
</p>

</div>


<div class="edu-grid">


<div class="edu-column">

<h4>
⚡ [A] ATTENTION
</h4>

<p>
<strong>Core idea:</strong>
Your attention is a limited resource. Every interruption creates a switching cost because your brain must reconstruct what it was doing.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Study:</strong>
Track how often you leave the target task, why you leave it, and how long it takes to return.
</p>

<p class="edu-accent-text">
QUESTION → How many minutes of your work session were actually devoted to the intended task?
</p>

</div>


<div class="edu-column">

<h4>
📈 [B] BEHAVIOR
</h4>

<p>
<strong>Core idea:</strong>
Intentions describe what you want. Behavior reveals what your current system actually produces.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Study:</strong>
Compare planned actions with completed actions across several days instead of judging yourself from one day.
</p>

<p class="edu-accent-text">
QUESTION → What repeatedly happens when motivation disappears?
</p>

</div>


<div class="edu-column">

<h4>
⚓ [L] LEVERAGE
</h4>

<p>
<strong>Core idea:</strong>
Some actions produce outputs that continue working after the action is finished. These are often more valuable than tasks that must be repeated manually.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Study:</strong>
Look for automation, reusable assets, skills, systems, relationships, documentation, and processes that multiply future output.
</p>

<p class="edu-accent-text">
QUESTION → Which action creates value beyond the hour in which you perform it?
</p>

</div>


<div class="edu-column">

<h4>
⚙ [E] ENVIRONMENT
</h4>

<p>
<strong>Core idea:</strong>
People do not make decisions in a vacuum. Physical layout, software defaults, notifications, availability, and friction influence behavior.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Study:</strong>
Make desired actions easier to start and undesirable distractions harder to access.
</p>

<p class="edu-accent-text">
QUESTION → What behavior does your environment make easiest?
</p>

</div>


</div>

</div>


